<title>MONACO: ATHLETICS-WORLD RECORD BREAKERS TO EARN $100,000.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD RECORD BREAKERS TO EARN $100,000.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athletes who break world records at the world outdoor championships in Athens this year will earn $100,000, the International Amateur Athletic Federation (IAAF) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In a statement the IAAF said world record breakers at next week's world indoor championships in Paris would get $50,000.</p>
